 are available; the largest ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".large"},{"type":"text","text":") can optionally display a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"marker"}]},{"type":"text","text":", i.e. a small brand-coloured"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rectangle rendered below the text (when the current theme declares it supports one)."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"OUDSHeading"}}}